	(text "2S4P Li-ion Battery Pack Interface\n\nJ401 Pinout:\n1 - BATT_N\n2 - CELL1\n3 - BATT_P\n4 - NTC_BAT\n\nBattery temperature sensor: 10k NTC, referenced to BATT_N\nNTC_BAT return is internally connected to BATT_N inside battery pack."
